{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/s5.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2500\u2500&quot;Ghosturbance Cases&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supernatural phenomena beyond human comprehension, seemingly the work of spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As these incidents rapidly increased, they came to be known as <strong>&quot;Ghosturbance Cases&quot;</strong> and became part of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;Angelic Agency,&quot; an organization investigating these cases, assigns its officer, Tsujitsuma, to a murder investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While Tsujitsuma approaches the case as part of his duties, the story takes an unexpected turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key to unraveling all these incidents lies in\u2014<strong>&quot;memories.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/s4.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Angelic Agency: Soul Salvation Unit&quot; is a mystery adventure featuring a public security duo tackling supernatural cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players take on the role of <strong>Tsujitsuma</strong>, a member of the <strong>&quot;Angelic Agency&quot;</strong> investigating <strong>&quot;Ghosturbance Cases.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game progresses through three phases: <strong>(1) Conversation Part, (2) Deduction Part, and (3) Salvation Part.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players navigate these phases to uncover the truth behind each incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/\u2605\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-08-03_093345.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(1) Conversation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to characters' stories and gather information by investigating scenes through point-and-click interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(2) Deduction Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden truths using collected evidence and testimonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;memories&quot; of spirits serve as keys to solving the cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(3) Salvation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reflect on the entirety of the incident and deliver judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-01-19_181443.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/s6.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A visual novel featuring numerous illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Point-and-click investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parameters that change based on choices, leading to multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-08-10_071732.png?t=1739791395\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370180?t=1739791395","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370180?t=1739791395","capsule_image":"https://shar