&quot;Ghosturbance Cases.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game progresses through three phases: <strong>(1) Conversation Part, (2) Deduction Part, and (3) Salvation Part.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players navigate these phases to uncover the truth behind each incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/\u2605\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2024-08-03_093345.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(1) Conversation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to characters' stories and gather information by investigating scenes through point-and-click interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(2) Deduction Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden truths using collected evidence and testimonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The &quot;memories&quot; of spirits serve as keys to solving the cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(3) Salvation Part</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reflect on the entirety of the incident and deliver judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-01-19_181443.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370180/extras/s6.png?t=1739791395\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A visual novel featuring numerous illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Point-and-click investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parameters that change based on choices, leading to multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character interactions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar